WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Your projects share one board.

00:03.500 --> 00:09.000
Press / to filter by project or task title.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.500
Enter opens a task. Esc takes you back.

00:11.500 --> 00:20.500
Press n. Pick a project and describe the change.

00:20.500 --> 00:24.000
Ctrl+S saves it. Press x to run it.

00:24.000 --> 00:29.000
The executor opens beside a shell in the task’s worktree.

00:29.000 --> 00:37.000
Claude adds the size-guide code. Waiting time is trimmed.

00:37.000 --> 00:45.000
The executor edits the product page and styles.

00:45.000 --> 00:54.000
Later: task done. All seven tests pass in the adjacent shell.
